## Widget smoke test decision

`TodayPaymentReportDialogTrigger` passes `withdrawController` into `_TodayPaymentReportDialogBody`, which:

1. Calls `loadTodayPaymentReport` on `initState`
2. After `FutureBuilder` resolves, reads `todayPaymentReportStateFor` / `todayPaymentReportErrorFor` from controller cache

A test-only subclass could override `loadTodayPaymentReport`, but the dialog body also depends on private `_todayPaymentReportCache` entries updated only inside `_fetchTodayPaymentReport`. Faking success/error/empty paths would require either repository injection refactors or a heavy GetX DI harness â€” out of scope per task resolution.

